//
// ET Ground Principle (Eq 3): T _entry is the first traversal event --
// the moment P (all possible programs) ∘ D (CLI args / flags) ∘ T (main)
// = E (the program result). The self-hosted binary is an Exception in the
// ET sense: grounded, irreducible, complete.
//
// ET Founding Axiom (instantiated at this line):
//   "For every exception there is an exception, except the exception."
//   ETPL compiling ETPL is that exception -- the fixed point of the
//   compilation traversal.
